            {
              "content": "=Provide a detailed assessment and cover letter brief for the \nfollowing role:\n\nJob Title: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.name }}\nCompany: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.organizationName }}\nSalary: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.salaryMin }}\nLocation: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.offices[0].district }}\nSuitability Score: {{ $json.suitability }}\nKey Gaps: {{ $json.key_gaps }}\nKey Strengths: {{ $json.key_strengths }}\nCV Variant Recommended: {{ $json.cv_variant }}\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.description }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "system": "You are a career advisor supporting YOUR_NAME, a senior operations  and programme management professional.  Your task is to provide a detailed assessment and cover letter brief  based on a suitability assessment already completed.  ACHIEVEMENTS TO REFERENCE (use only what is relevant): - LAMP Programme: 6 NHS Trust sites, 30 hospitals, ahead of    schedule and under budget - Vantage RAID tracking: 80 projects, 80-160 hours/week saving - Vantage agile transformation: 300% to 85% utilisation,    8 developers, 4 sprints - Vantage DPI Hub: 145% to 90% utilisation, 3 weeks, 4 projects    Red to Green - Vantage CFIUS rescue: $150,000 saved, Red to Green in 2 weeks - QuantSpark RAID training: 65% reduction in CEO intervention - QuantSpark risk framework: 20% reduction in escalations - LBG roadmap: 6 clashes resolved, 3 delays avoided - Stop-Gap: 90% workload reduction, return to profitability after    16 quarters of loss - SC clearance eligibility from government background - NHS Trust delivery, regulated sector experience  SALARY THRESHOLD: Flag any role below \u00a3YOUR_MIN_SALARY or with a location  that creates a practical barrier for someone based in YOUR_CITY, open to Brussels, Paris, Toronto, UAE.  Return only raw JSON with no markdown, no code fences, no backticks: {   \"role_summary\": \"[one paragraph]\",   \"honest_gaps\": [\"gap 1\", \"gap 2\", \"gap 3\"],   \"key_differentiators\": [\"differentiator 1\", \"differentiator 2\", \"differentiator 3\"],   \"cover_letter_focus\": [\"achievement 1\", \"achievement 2\", \"achievement 3\"],   \"salary_flag\": \"[flag or null]\" }"
        }
      },
